================================================================================
Corresponding source (GNU GPL v2, section 3)
================================================================================

This package distributes the Doom engine in compiled (WebAssembly) form as
engine/doom.js and engine/doom.wasm. Those two files are an UNMODIFIED copy of
the Emscripten build produced by pi-doom, which compiles doomgeneric. The
complete corresponding source code for that engine is publicly available at:

  - doomgeneric:  https://github.com/ozkl/doomgeneric
  - pi-doom (build + WAD packaging):  https://github.com/badlogic/pi-doom

The maintainers of kaboom.claude will also, on request, provide the complete
corresponding source for the bundled engine build, per GPL-2.0 section 3.

================================================================================
Modifications (GNU GPL v2, section 2a)
================================================================================

- src/doom-engine.js is a derivative of pi-doom's src/doom-engine.ts, ported to
  CommonJS by the kaboom.claude authors in 2026.
- src/doom-keys.js reimplements pi-doom's key mapping without external
  dependencies (rewritten by the kaboom.claude authors in 2026).
- src/play.js, src/split.js, and bin/kaboom.claude.js are original works of the
  kaboom.claude authors, licensed GPL-2.0-or-later.
- engine/doom.js and engine/doom.wasm are unmodified from pi-doom.

